## General Description
The 5.6x14mm Nano cartridge is a miniscule rimmed centerfire cartridge. While generally too weak for military use, the Nano is popular for target shooting and small-game hunting thanks to its light weight, low recoil, and low damage. It can also be found in use with concealed weapons, including the use of specialized subsonic "stealth" rounds by covert operatives. 

